Preferably a Chartered Accountant, with significant experience in Big Four or corporate;
smaller CA firms less preferred.
Looking for someone with global experience, handling multiple jurisdictions;
4+ years of experience, up to 89 years is acceptable.
Strong knowledge of TP documentation is essential;
Seeking candidates with dedicated India experience and those with a mix of India and global experience.
